==== hyperbricks yaml {!{fragment}} ====
fragment:
  - type: fragment
  - response:
      headers:
        HX-Refresh: "true"
==== explainer ====
If set to 'true' the client-side will do a full refresh of the page
==== expected json ====
{
  "Cache": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<FRAGMENT>",
  "ContentType": "",
  "Enclose": "",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Index": 0,
  "Items": null,
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "NoCache": false,
  "Response": {
    "Headers": {
      "HX-Refresh": "true"
    },
    "Status": 0
  },
  "Route": "",
  "Section": "",
  "Static": "",
  "Template": null,
  "Title": ""
}

==== expected output ====
